{"kind":"grammar","lang":"en","entities":{"n5-918":{"renderings":[{"id":"ef3178ecf781c62f","role":"label","field":"name","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-918"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"て-form"},{"id":"7a2d7840b55d0325","role":"prose","field":"shortExplanation","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-918"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"The connective で that joins clauses, the copula's て-form."},{"id":"5f4eaee31d7934eb","role":"prose","field":"longExplanation","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-918"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"で is the て-form of the copula, used to join clauses the way a verb's て-form does (静かで、きれいです, 'it's quiet and clean')."},{"id":"2a6487dbfc6d3389","role":"prose","field":"formation","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-918"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"な-Adjective / Noun + で: 静かで, 学生で."},{"id":"c14ec4778f0be890","role":"label","field":"derives","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-918"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"て-form (で)"}]}}}